{"seq":1,"slug":"artificial-intelligence","title":"人工智能","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence","introMarkdown":"# 人工智能 简介\n\n人工智能致力于让计算机系统展现出通常需要人类智能才能完成的能力：理解语言、识别图像、做出决策、从经验中学习。这个领域在过去十年经历了革命性的飞跃——深度学习的突破使得机器在围棋、图像识别、自然语言理解等任务上达到甚至超越了人类水平，也深刻地改变了几乎所有行业的技术格局。\n\n自学人工智能需要在数学基础和工程直觉之间找到平衡。线性代数、概率论和优化理论是理解算法原理的必备工具，而编程能力和实验素养则让你能够将理论付诸实践。好消息是，当前的开源生态极为丰富，你可以在个人电脑上复现许多经典实验。\n\n本学习空间将人工智能的核心知识组织为四个章节。**第一章 人工智能基础** 介绍经典 AI 的核心方法，包括搜索算法、知识表示和机器学习的基本概念，帮助你建立对这个领域的全局认知。**第二章 深度学习** 深入神经网络的世界，从基本架构出发，探讨卷积网络在图像识别中的应用和循环网络在序列建模中的角色。**第三章 自然语言处理与计算机视觉** 聚焦 AI 最成功的两大应用领域，讨论文本理解、图像识别以及多模态学习的最新进展。**第四章 AI 应用** 展示人工智能如何走出实验室进入现实世界，涵盖机器人与自主系统、医疗 AI 和 AI 伦理治理等前沿话题。\n\n建议从第一章的经典方法开始建立直觉，再进入深度学习的现代范式。每学一个算法，都动手用代码实现一遍，在真实数据上观察它的行为——这是理解 AI 最不可替代的学习方式。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-foundations","title":"人工智能基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-history-overview","title":"人工智能发展史与概论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-foundations/ai-history-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"search-optimization","title":"搜索与优化算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-foundations/search-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-representation","title":"知识表示与推理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-foundations/knowledge-representation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"deep-learning","title":"深度学习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/deep-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neural-network-fundamentals","title":"神经网络基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/deep-learning/neural-network-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cnn-architectures","title":"卷积神经网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/deep-learning/cnn-architectures"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sequence-models","title":"序列模型与Transformer","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/deep-learning/sequence-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"nlp-cv","title":"自然语言处理与计算机视觉","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/nlp-cv","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"text-processing","title":"自然语言处理基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/nlp-cv/text-processing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"computer-vision-basics","title":"计算机视觉基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/nlp-cv/computer-vision-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multimodal-ai","title":"多模态AI","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/nlp-cv/multimodal-ai"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-applications","title":"AI 应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"recommendation-systems","title":"推荐系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-applications/recommendation-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reinforcement-learning","title":"强化学习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-applications/reinforcement-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-ethics-governance","title":"AI伦理与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/ai-applications/ai-ethics-governance"}]}]}